  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2" style="border: 1px dashed #333; padding: 8px;"><p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Learning Outcome:</b> Listening: Can show comprehension of instructions in simple counting games (e.g., 'Hold up five fingers.'). Can repeat counting songs or rhymes (e.g., 'One, two, three, four, five.'). Can recognize spoken numbers up to ten when accompanied by gestures (e.g., hears 'three' and holds up three fingers).</p></td>
  </tr>
